12	 * comment on a fork's pull request therefore handed a branch of the fork — or a
13	 * same-named branch of this repository — to a workflow that runs `--ref` against this
14	 * repository. The gates live here so that both entrances ask the same question of the
15	 * same code; `domain/work/pr-head-branch.ts` holds the pure half, what each refusal is
16	 * and what it says.
